1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:02,890
(Sheldon:)Lucky Baldwin's.

2
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:06,790
(Sheldon:)Oh, I've heard
of that place.

3
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:10,530
(Sheldon:)Isn't that Pasadena's
favorite Irish watering hole?

4
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:12,300
(Howard:)Yes.

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,600
(Sheldon:)Did you meet

6
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:14,860
(Sheldon:)anyone interesting there,

7
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:19,100
(Sheldon:)perhaps a promiscuous,
redheaded barmaid?

8
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,100
(Leonard:)As a matter of fact...
I-I-I-I-I can't, I can't,

9
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:22,540
(Leonard:)I can't do it.

10
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:25,110
(Sheldon:)Sure you can, you're doing
fine, it's very believable.

11
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:28,580
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, Raj,
but the truth is,

12
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:30,450
(Leonard:)I was with Priya
last night.

13
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:31,650
(Sheldon:)Don't listen to him.

14
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:33,420
He's still light-headed
from all the Irish whiskey

15
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,290
(Sheldon:)and pickled eggs
in his system.

16
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:37,220
(Howard:)What were you doing
with Priya?

17
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,250
(Sheldon:)I believe they engaged
in coitus,

18
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:40,060
(Sheldon:)but more
importantly,

19
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,830
(Sheldon:)if Leonard had not abandoned
his story,

20
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:44,260
(Sheldon:)would you have found it
plausible?

21
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,800
You slept with my sister?!

22
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:46,730
(Leonard:)Yeah.

23
00:00:46,730 --> 00:00:48,970
(Howard:)How could you?
We had a pact.

24
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:50,770
(Raj:)Excuse me, I think
"How could you? She's my sister"

25
00:00:50,770 --> 00:00:53,970
(Raj:)takes precedence over
a five-year-old pinky swear.

26
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:55,390
(Sheldon:)May I point out,

27
00:00:55,390 --> 00:00:57,640
(Sheldon:)in a parallel universe,
your friends are saying

28
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,280
"Maggie McGarry--
she sounds lovely."

